{"step_index":435,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T03:07:10Z","thinking":"**Discovering New Data**\n\nI've located fresh verification data (CEO, address, phone number, corporate registration number, etc.) for a staggering 220 out of 226 target companies! My next step is to integrate this supplementary data into the existing 1,000-row Excel file. I'll highlight all the newly-input cells in orange for easy identification.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Apply all 220 deep enriched updates to 1,000 rows Excel and apply orange styling.\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import openpyxl\\nimport json\\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Alignment, Border, Side\\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\\n\\nbase_excel = r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사_DB_배현명_1000행_전수정제_최종완성본.xlsx\\\"\\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(base_excel)\\nws = wb[\\\"실사DB_1000행_전수정제완료\\\"]\\n\\nwith open(r'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\\\scratch\\\\cross_lookup_results.json', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    cross_results = json.load(f)\\n\\norange_fill = PatternFill(start_color=\\\"F8CBAD\\\", end_color=\\\"F8CBAD\\\", fill_type=\\\"solid\\\")\\norange_font = Font(name=\\\"맑은 고딕\\\", size=10, bold=True, color=\\\"C00000\\\")\\n\\nthin_border = Border(\\n    left=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9'),\\n    right=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9'),\\n    top=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9'),\\n    bottom=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9')\\n)\\n\\ntotal_new_cells = 0\\nupdated_rows_set = set()\\n\\nfor item in cross_results:\\n    r_idx = item['row_idx']\\n    updates = item['updates']\\n    if not updates:\\n        continue\\n        \\n    updated_rows_set.add(r_idx)\\n    \\n    # Map fields to col index\\n    # 5: ceo, 7: addr, 8: phone, 14: corp_no, 15: s